HYP-3111 Minkowski/circuit/Ising/De Moivre carrier scout -- codex S264
This scout integrates HYP-3108/HYP-3109/HYP-3110 with the user-requested sources.

External source hooks used:
  Minkowski theorem: symmetric convex body volume threshold 2^n * covolume.
  Circuit complexity: circuit size = gate count; depth = longest input-output path.
  Lee-Yang/Ising: finite ferromagnetic partition zeros are the whole zero-set sidecar.
  De Moivre quintic: x^5 + 5*a*x^3 + 5*a^2*x + b = 0 folds through y^2+b*y-a^5.

